### Changes in this version (8.1.1) since 8.0.0

#### New features:
 - [%as:]: added in-core/out-core ('-rw') option for std2
 - [%as:]: added support for configurables index
 - [%as:]: allowed no limit on method part endpoint
 - [%as:]: added ID to method part end point
 - [%as:]: added method endpoints to get programs/destinations matching a class name
 - [%as:]: added atom_defaults to other program parsers
 - [%as:]: added option to disable the xtb density cube file

#### Bugfixes:
 - [%as:]: fixed a bug when using basis sets from the BSE that don't contain ECPs
 - [%as:]: added patch for unusual charactres in endpoints
 - [%as:]: fixed xTB calculations crashing if topo file is missing for some reason
 - [%as:]: fixed error message when trying to delete xtb cube file but no results have been parsed
 - [%as:]: fixed xTB program not using latest 6.7.1
 - [%as:]: ulimit is now automatically set based on the total allocated memory

#### Documentation changes:
 - [%as:]: updated documentation to v8 references

#### Testing updates:
 - [%as:]: updated tests to reflect new methods in libary

#### Miscellaneous:
 - [%as:]: update last modified
 - [%as:]: bumped version to 8.1.1, upgrade digilib to the same
 - [%as:]: update last modified
 - [%as:]: replaced missing chars with empty strings instead of underscores in endpoint
 - [%as:]: fixed wrong type for xtb cube option
 - [%as:]: added better handling of xTB cube file
 - [%as:]: bumped version to 8.1.0-pre.1
 - [%as:]: added SOS-wPBEPP86 to auto characterisation
 - [%as:]: bumped version to 8.0.0-pre.1
 - [%as:]: added SCS and SOS version of wPBEPP86 to library
 - [%as:]: updated docs workflow
 - [%as:]: bumped version to 8.0.0